abstract: >-
  An open, Zotero-backed academic bibliography on Assassin's Creed (Game Studies
  & Digital Humanities), organized across four taxonomy dimensions and 32
  controlled tags, paired with a config-driven OpenAlex + Multi-LLM curation
  pipeline and zero-dependency web catalog.
